om/godotengine/godot/issues/104369#issuecomment-2737365891","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104369","id":2737365891,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jKOOD","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T16:48:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T16:48:57Z","body":"Try changing **Vulkan/OpenGL present method** to **Prefer DXGI swapchain** in the NVIDIA Control Panel for the Godot executable.\n\nYou can also try switching the rendering `driver_name.windows` to `d3d12` in the Project Settings to use Godot's Direct3D 12 renderer, which automatically uses DXGI for presentation.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737365891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737435838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104369#issuecomment-2737435838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104369","id":2737435838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jKfS-","user":{"login":"ghuser404","id":33043976,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDQzOTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33043976?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404","html_url":"https://github.com/ghuser404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T17:09:57Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T17:09:57Z","body":"Yeah, with `Prefer DXGI swapchain` it doesn't flicker on start. Also, I tried fullscreen on master, it also doesn't flicker.\nWhat is the actual difference between fullscreen and fullscreen exclusive in Vulkan with the changes in master (given that the border is no longer there)?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737435838/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741561239","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104369#issuecomment-2741561239","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104369","id":2741561239,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jaOeX","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T20:14:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T20:14:50Z","body":"> What is the actual difference between fullscreen and fullscreen exclusive in Vulkan with the changes in master (given that the border is no longer there)?\n\nNon-exclusive mode ensures multiple windows can be displayed on top of each other, exclusive does not. The border is still there, but now it's off screen and transparent.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741561239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741615187","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104369#issuecomment-2741615187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104369","id":2741615187,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jabpT","user":{"login":"ghuser404","id":33043976,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDQzOTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33043976?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404","html_url":"https://github.com/ghuser404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T20:42:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T20:43:35Z","body":"@bruvzg Is it still true for Vulkan though? Because I can still drag other windows on top of my Godot app when it's in exclusive fullscreen mode.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741615187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741645241","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104369#issuecomment-2741645241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104369","id":2741645241,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jai-5","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T20:58:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T20:58:12Z","body":"Yes, but it depends on the driver and DXGI config, it might work in exclusive fullscreen in some conditions, but not guaranteed to work.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741645241/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741763747","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104369#issuecomment-2741763747","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104369","id":2741763747,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ja_6j","user":{"login":"ghuser404","id":33043976,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDQzOTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33043976?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404","html_url":"https://github.com/ghuser404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T22:00:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T22:00:46Z","body":"So I just tested this with Discord overlay. Indeed, in exclusive fullscreen the overlay doesn't show up. But ONLY if there is a flicker (so if the window starts with Vsync OFF). If I set it to ON or start with ON and set it to OFF, then the window is no longer exclusive, and the overlay shows up. This is quite inconsistent, but I guess this is how the driver behaves?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741763747/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741813589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104369#issuecomment-2741813589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104369","id":2741813589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jbMFV","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T22:34:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T22:34:45Z","body":"> This is quite inconsistent, but I guess this is how the driver behaves?\n\nIt is inconsistent, but we do not have direct control over it, it's up to driver to decide when to enable exclusive mode. We can either do nothing (that's what `MODE_EXCLUSIVE_FULLSCREEN` do), or force it not to enable it (`MODE_FULLSCREEN`). Flicker is expected result of it being enabled (switching to another window require temporary disabling exclusive mode).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741813589/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]